Subject: [PATCH 013/125] Fix cbo exception

---
 core/execution_units/load_store_unit/load_store_unit.sv | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/execution_units/load_store_unit/load_store_unit.sv b/core/execution_units/load_store_unit/load_store_unit.sv
